The '''Warbird Skiff''' was a model of [[skiff]] used by the [[Warbird gang]] during the [[First Order-Resistance War]]. The skiff was a heavily-modified [[repulsorlift]] that used [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] parts and other scavenged pieces.<ref name="Ult" />

